# `deployments/d3-session-addresses.json` is deliberately NOT here. `sessions:generate`
# splits its output on purpose — private keys to `.secrets/` (ignored above), public
# addresses to `deployments/`. Ignoring the public half undid that split and left
# `docs/deployed-contracts.md` publishing five addresses whose canonical source did not
# ship, so `bun run check` passed here and failed on every clone. The same five addresses
# are already in that tracked document; this file discloses nothing new.

